                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is Ayurveda a real global opportunity?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — $10B+ global TAM growing 12-18% annually. Western wellness buyers actively seek authentic traditional systems.</p>
                                        <h3>How do I get AYUSH licence?</h3>
                                        <p>Apply via state AYUSH department. Classical formulations easier than proprietary. Timeline: 3-9 months. Cost: ₹1-5 lakh.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I sell Ayurveda in USA?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes as dietary supplements. Cannot make disease claims. Structure-function claims with FDA disclaimer allowed.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I do dosha assessment onboarding?</h3>
